==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Expedition|Pidgey|123}} from the {{TCG|Expedition Base Set}}; both cards have the Peck attack.
*{{m|Peck}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Pidgey}} cannot learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Y}}.

